# Tolaria taps to add exactly one blue mana and cannot tap again until untapped (CR 605.1a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Tolaria
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Tolaria.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Tolaria.Activate(Ability: Add {U})
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tolaria.Tapped = true
! Bot1.Battlefield.Tolaria.Activate(Ability: Add {U})
[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {U}
